  unitName: Del Bardo
  unitId: 50673
  unitNumber: 943
  description: A machine from another world which somehow ended up in Ishgria. Compared
    to La Guardo, Del Bardo boasts of much more power and can take out enemies from
    great distances. Whenever it sees its "master" in danger, it shoots countless
    of projectiles from both of its arms in order to completely exterminate the enemy.
    Besides its fighting capabilities, it is because this machine displays so much
    interest in taking care of its master that some believe it is somewhat capable
    of emotion.
  summonDesc: MASTER...I SEARCHED FOR YOU...<br>I WILL PROTECT YOU...<br>EVEN IF
    I BREAK INTO PIECES...
  fusionDesc: '*Beep* *beep* *beep*<br>ENERGY INTAKE...<br>MAXIMIZED.'
  evoDesc: THANK YOU...<br>MORE UPDATES, PLEASE...<br>I WANT TO PROTECT MASTER...
